	case "$page" in
	1)
		whiptail --title "About – 7z Compression Profile Manager" \
			--scrolltext --msgbox "\
7z Compression Profile Manager
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

A whiptail menu-driven tool for managing reusable
7z ultra-compression profiles.

VERSION:  1.2
PROFILES: ~/.config/7z-profiler/profiles/
LOGS:     ~/.config/7z-profiler/logs/

WHAT IT DOES
────────────
• Create, edit, duplicate, and delete compression
  profiles so you never have to retype long 7z
  commands.
• Each profile stores source path, destination
  path, and all compression parameters (including
  dictionary size and CPU thread count).
• Dedicated Encrypted Archive mode with AES-256
  and Header Encryption (-mhe=on) to protect files
  and hide filenames.
• Run any saved profile with a single menu pick –
